{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:601ebe0fb7ce9dc83d38a5c2ed260afee9643c5658236daee6940719ccf12623",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aac0150c753f75c510dac9d00e4ab725002c3af99ce353ba6a054436515cc2cf",
      "text": "资讯节目大扫除特辑客串出演的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a47e88814dc7102e98c94e1c07fc07599dd22e5e18fe7efe7015cbb555929535",
      "text": "“水槽的污垢非常顽固。若是按寻常方法\n打扫，会耗费大量时间”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:106dbb5f210ec5c052ad79f173c05665e0e977da697c049e53b4232f57aeb023",
      "text": "“然而，在清洁水槽等不锈钢材质时，\n橄榄油却极为有效”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba676d4f9a1914dfa2aaa32205d2e9876d8a10fa605740c90fbda24035603a47",
      "text": "“那么，现在就来进行实操演示”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000034:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b778da12e44b043eb3a21bef897722f6e5014accfaf2495bacec6def645c7bcf",
      "text": "拍摄后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d05606a5d16e7829d9d2335f774c165e832e01893069db95f6331d24815029c",
      "text": "道夫先生，辛苦了。\n橄榄油的那段讲解，表现得非常好哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be6b3dc84ef9690c2efff3d7f53801b57dc23cc8ff86c6ce32d3a4843ccdf74f",
      "text": "那段最开始并没有写在台本上呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95490e0c01d539c266e1a1ddc02e52475fb9d9041d6ebb40997651d6da344a11",
      "text": "嗯，橄榄油的妙用\n是我在碰头会时提到的清洁方法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fb2fd0e3be5ede7bb6ef06e4c9aa22f4c3e1ecb9c326d9468e8a50cc101a739",
      "text": "毕竟这次的主题是“身边的物品化身清洁工具！？”，\n大概是正好契合了节目的主旨吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20cabe04673237027454b8ded15eb593688c148c0a2965e6c9139137b342885f",
      "text": "是的，非常完美！录制也顺利\n结束了，我们回事务所吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d842d49d4c8e454f903b2ebdf37e945af611396ec3b3d4c3c17e58ac48fc77f",
      "text": "事务所……说起来，我之前就很在意\n事务所厨房水槽里的污垢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_02:1_5_035_02:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfe1658c915df2ec9441daef3bf33a24c32cc6d5a7f51c1bbd93baa0e87178d3",
      "text": "正好是个好机会，这就去清理一下吧。\n你若方便的话，可否也来搭把手？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
